  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are many problems with the new rank system. Ever since there was the new rank system, when I made an avatar and tried to upload it in unity with the plugin, it always says \"You can't upload this, you need to enjoy the app more! and also rank up to at least new user, too.\" and it's very bothersome. I can't even rank up! Ever since the new rank system was made, nobody told how to use it at all! Any new players ever since the new rank system are literally alienated in all cases of ranks, which doesn't allow them to rank up at all. Even with the non steam version, same problem happens. Players that have this problem, are really annoyed of how you made that glitch. Please fix it, all I just want is to create an avatar.",
